1
00:00:00,917 --> 00:00:02,168
Why not?

2
00:00:02,794 --> 00:00:03,759
I think I'm going

3
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,838
to quit.

4
00:00:05,797 --> 00:00:07,501
Let's wrap up the meeting here

5
00:00:07,502 --> 00:00:09,592
and Suzy, please stay.

6
00:00:14,097 --> 00:00:15,015
Go ahead, speak up.

7
00:00:15,015 --> 00:00:15,982
Why are you suddenly

8
00:00:15,983 --> 00:00:17,267
deciding to quit?

9
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:18,727
That's just how it is.

10
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:19,519
Why?

11
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:20,392
Were you worried

12
00:00:20,393 --> 00:00:21,271
I would flirt with you?

13
00:00:21,271 --> 00:00:22,522
That's not it.

14
00:00:22,522 --> 00:00:23,898
Then why?

15
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:26,067
Why are you leaving?

16
00:00:26,818 --> 00:00:28,174
At least finish this

17
00:00:28,175 --> 00:00:29,738
project before you go.

18
00:00:29,738 --> 00:00:30,986
How can you leave

19
00:00:30,987 --> 00:00:32,532
so irresponsibly?

20
00:00:33,908 --> 00:00:35,201
I'm sorry.

21
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:39,456
So, you're still a lowlife.

22
00:00:39,914 --> 00:00:41,639
I was a fool to think you

23
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,126
might have changed a bit.

24
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,007
I gave a chance to a lowlife

25
00:00:45,008 --> 00:00:46,755
and now you're defying me.

26
00:00:47,172 --> 00:00:48,190
You're more of a lowlife

27
00:00:48,191 --> 00:00:49,257
than I am, Director.

28
00:00:49,257 --> 00:00:50,300
Even if I lived recklessly

29
00:00:50,301 --> 00:00:51,593
it wasn't to that extent.

30
00:00:51,593 --> 00:00:52,862
I'm holding back

31
00:00:52,863 --> 00:00:54,387
for the team leader's sake.

32
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:56,181
If anything happens to her

33
00:00:56,514 --> 00:00:57,724
I'll be dancing with knives.

34
00:01:01,603 --> 00:01:02,771
I'm sorry.

35
00:01:03,563 --> 00:01:04,899
You're running away

36
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,566
just like before.
